sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as You
  participant E as Netlify CDN
  participant F as Function
  C->>E: GET /api/generate?theme=dog&blocks=3
  alt Already cached
    E-->>C: 200 JSON, from the cache
  else Not cached
    E->>F: Run the function
    F->>F: Read the query strictly
    alt Well-formed request
      F->>F: generateText()
      F-->>E: 200 JSON, cache for 1 hour
      E-->>C: 200 JSON
    else Anything else
      F-->>E: 400 JSON, never cached
      E-->>C: 400 JSON
    end
  end
